ref('semenovtianshansky1973kirillov',author='Semenov-Tian-Shansky, M. A.',title='A certain property of the {Kirillov} integral',journal='Zapiski Nauchnykh Seminarov LOMI',year=1973,volume=37,pages='53--65',url='https://www.mathnet.ru/eng/znsl2637',annote='Math-Net metadata and full Russian primary PDF opened. Introduction pp. 53--54, Lemma 2.7, Proposition 2.8 and section 4 theorem read. The exact stationary-phase conclusion is stated for compact semisimple orbits; noncompact regularization is explicitly outside the article’s scope.')
